{"product_id":"read-it-yourself-with-ladybird-level-1-collection","title":"Read It Yourself with Ladybird – Level 1 Collection(15 Books)","description":"\u003cp data-start=\"398\" data-end=\"449\"\u003eSmall stories. Big confidence. Endless smiles. 💫\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp data-start=\"451\" data-end=\"685\"\u003eMeet the magical world of Read It Yourself with Ladybird – Level 1, where classic tales and modern favourites are rewritten with simple words and bright pictures — perfect for children taking their very first steps into reading.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp data-start=\"687\" data-end=\"975\"\u003eEach book is crafted with short sentences, familiar vocabulary, and gentle repetition to help young readers (ages 4–6) build confidence one page at a time. Whether it’s a hungry goat, a busy hen, or Peppa Pig exploring tiny creatures, these stories make reading time feel like playtime.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp data-start=\"977\" data-end=\"1164\"\u003eWith Ladybird’s trusted learning structure, each Level 1 story is designed to be \u003cem data-start=\"1058\" data-end=\"1090\"\u003eread together, then read alone\u003c\/em\u003e — the perfect way to turn early learners into proud little readers. \u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp data-start=\"977\" data-end=\"1164\"\u003eTITLES - \u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cul data-start=\"1200\" data-end=\"1622\"\u003e\n\u003cli data-start=\"1200\" data-end=\"1226\"\u003e\n\u003cp data-start=\"1202\" data-end=\"1226\"\u003eThe Magic Porridge Pot\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli data-start=\"1227\" data-end=\"1258\"\u003e\n\u003cp data-start=\"1229\" data-end=\"1258\"\u003eThe Three Billy Goats Gruff\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli data-start=\"1259\" data-end=\"1280\"\u003e\n\u003cp data-start=\"1261\" data-end=\"1280\"\u003eThe Ugly Duckling\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli data-start=\"1281\" data-end=\"1295\"\u003e\n\u003cp data-start=\"1283\" data-end=\"1295\"\u003eCinderella\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003c